{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16202200","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16202200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1620220001:1":{"text":"グレム、お前に……お別れを言いに来たんだ。","source_cn":"格墨文，我来看看你……也算是送别吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97A784DBE3A96220","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1620220002:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620220003:1":{"text":"元気――なわけないよな。でも俺は、お前を笑いに来たわけでも、同情しに来たわけでもなくて、その……","source_cn":"你还好吗？我知道你心有不满，但我不是想嘲笑你或者是施舍...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03A90CB85E71858B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620220004:1":{"text":"くだらない前置きはけっこうだ。要件だけを言え。","source_cn":"省掉这些虚伪无用的问候语，有什么话就直说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC392A81C1502694E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620220005:1":{"text":"っ……俺は、お前にたくさん助けられたのに、お前が一番助けを必要としていたときに、力になってやれなかった……だから、友だちとして、お前に謝りたいんだ。","source_cn":"你帮过我很多，我却无法在你需要的时候给予你帮助……站在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6203BF59D075EC01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_femal