ocument_title_status":""},"say:28:1620220026:0":{"text":"確かに俺は、一族の再興のために頑張ってきた。けど俺だって、やっちゃいけないことぐらいは分かる……","source_cn":"我的确是在为家族的重现荣光而奋斗，但我是有底线的……有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1700E39F1630ACB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:29::1":{"text":"破損したエヴァフレア","source_cn":"破碎的恒火之星","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48DAA5D8C3EDB73D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1620220027:2":{"text":"栄光の誓約を直すために、お前がくれたこの「エヴァフレア」……俺はこれを、お前との友情の証だと思ってる。それは、今も変わらない。","source_cn":"这枚“恒火之星”……你曾将它送给我，让我修复我的荣耀誓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27429A1A0A3FBFC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1620220028:1":{"text":"これは俺が預かっておくよ。いつか、俺の言ったこと理解して、自分が何を間違えたのか気づいてくれることを願ってる……","source_cn":"现在我将它还给你。我希望有一天你能明白我的想法，明白你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5009CA0FED8CA437","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1620220029:0":{"text":"その時は……またお前と友だちになれるよな？","source_cn":"我希望……或许那时候，我们还能是朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC501DBDA1535859","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:16202200